    <h1>Eccellenza<br><em>meccanica</em><br>per il tuo team</h1>
    <div class="az-pills"><span class="az-pill">↑ Aumento del fatturato</span><span class="az-pill">⬡ Team engineering</span><span class="az-pill">◈ Leadership efficace</span></div>
    <div class="azioni"><a class="btn btn-1" href="{{ base }}/aziende/servizi">Richiedi una consulenza →</a><a class="btn btn-2" href="{{ base }}/calcolo-human-design">Analizza la tua carta qui</a></div>
    <a class="cert" href="https://bg5businessinstitute.com/professionals?id=399d41b3-612b-48d1-88b9-7bc26ed71418" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="{{ base }}/user/themes/valentina/images/bg5-certified.png" alt="BG5 Certified"><span>Certified Career &amp; Business Professional</span></a>
  </div>
